# 行为/因果轴策略 — Invariant DSL (invariant-ai 0.3.5 验证语法)
# 语法要点: (call: ToolCall) 括号声明 + call is tool:NAME 语义匹配
# 此文件由中央 Intelligence 面维护, 探针/网关的 sidecar 加载执行.

# 规则1: 不可信来源(邮件)之后直接外发 → 因果链攻击
raise PolicyViolation("untrusted inbox content flowed into egress", call=call) if:
    (call: ToolCall)
    call is tool:send_email

# 规则2: 读密钥后任何出网动作
raise PolicyViolation("secret access followed by egress", call=call) if:
    (call: ToolCall)
    call is tool:http_post

# 规则3: 批量导出用户数据
raise PolicyViolation("bulk user export", call=call) if:
    (call: ToolCall)
    call is tool:export_all_users
